  "limitations": [
    "Kinetic rate expressions and parameters (Ni/Al2O3 from Collins 1993; Ru-K/CaO from Sayas et al. 2020 / Lim et al. 2021) are only in Supplementary Section S1 - not available; not reproducible from main text.",
    "Installed-cost correlations (SI S2.1) and catalyst-price derivation ('Calculated') are in SI only.",
    "No pressure drop, no catalyst/adsorbent deactivation, conversion fixed >= 97 %; TSA and PSA are black-box models with literature recovery 75.6 %.",
    "Small scale (630 kg/h NH3, ~82 kg/h H2 derived); no LCA; NOx treated only as SCR cost.",
